    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Ubedullah Rahimoon and Imran Mughal, students of the Master of Science in Nursing (MScN) programme at The Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery (AKU-SONAM), have been elected to the  18th Youth Parliament Pakistan (YPP) , representing the Tharparkar and Karachi West constituencies respectively.",
